    <name>VegasShootingMap.com</name>
    <description>This map is meant for research purposes. It is in no way meant to harm, defame, or devalue any of those tragically killed or injured by this heinous crime. If you have any corrections, concerns, or have a video you would like added, please reach out to us at VegasMapProjectTeam@googlegroups.com. Some video locations are best estimates. </description>
